{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "bcfb888fb426fbaad71c04c249e2f2aca6adea27dfd997cbd4c921f9979adab0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n聞いてください！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n请听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "66ced2e0ef86a1bac1dd40ac7d16141f70a5af1ca70aa55c9cda6c9f931dea67", "ja": "私、この前の撮影で\n「自然体がセクシーだね」って褒められちゃいました！", "zh": "我啊，在上次的拍摄中\n被夸了\"自然的状态真性感呢\"！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fd5921c321aeab96d1df83c734f4115fa91dd686816a0f2f7b9b9442d468c7a1", "ja": "この前っていうと、部屋着で撮影した時の？", "zh": "你说上次，是指穿着家居服拍摄的那次？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "017d35c204d838b41a28d0904f8fe124b95f842e6f5434b1ff37a79e4ccc8cb9", "ja": "そうです！　それでそれで、私、すっごく嬉しくて。\nもっと自然体な自分を撮ってみたんです。", "zh": "没错！然后然后，我特别开心。\n于是我试着拍下了更加自然的自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1004_p", "source_sha256": "10cc44d6bf1abdf143fa705b5d497c32bfe97a8165dd6168740a9e1c88bc8359", "ja": "おっ、いいじゃないか。上手く撮れたのか？", "zh": "哦，不错嘛。拍得还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "b983141723da6fa43fad3877c5089288f13e90d16b2ccceef21e2befa373731b", "ja": "はい！　それで、みんなにも見せたんですけど……。\n誰もセクシーって言ってくれなくて。", "zh": "是的！然后我也给大家看了……  \n可是，谁都没有说很性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "cb0508c8ee0951598c9ad2da39692da8f6f505a3d368f8d9d00d804f2f4ab53b", "ja": "おかしいな～、ちゃんと自然体を目指したのに。\nみんな、スゴイとしか言ってくれないんですよ。", "zh": "好奇怪啊～明明是认真以自然状态为目标的。\n大家却只会说“好厉害”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2e6419c9a7481a5341cc85f6a04a54494ce1b1669267031f3da6bff48e3e39a8", "ja": "（その後、見せて貰った写真は……険しい山の頂上で、\n最高の笑顔を浮かべる麗花を映したものだった）", "zh": "（之后，她给我看的照片中……丽花站在险峻的山顶，脸上洋溢着最灿烂的笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0252_1008_p", "source_sha256": "09a283e255436bb936f45888de20d554a0f966d31254f9cc12f4b99e540e7d7d", "ja": "（これはすごい！　すごく……自然だ！）", "zh": "（这可真厉害！非常……自然！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
